1
00:00:41,800 --> 00:00:42,660
Mister,

2
00:00:43,030 --> 00:00:45,100
why do you suddenly want
to teach me martial arts?

3
00:00:45,100 --> 00:00:46,860
Yesterday you said I was a spy.

4
00:00:48,930 --> 00:00:51,700
He's been looking at me
weirdly these past few days.

5
00:00:51,700 --> 00:00:54,200
And today he suddenly wants
to teach me cultivation.

6
00:00:54,200 --> 00:00:55,160
What is he up to?

7
00:00:57,600 --> 00:00:58,900
You are too weak.

8
00:00:59,400 --> 00:01:01,530
If the Demonic Cult takes you hostage,

9
00:01:01,860 --> 00:01:04,060
we'd have to waste manpower saving you.

10
00:01:05,900 --> 00:01:08,030
If she really is a spy
for the Demonic Cult,

11
00:01:08,030 --> 00:01:10,360
she will definitely expose her
spiritual power while practicing.

12
00:01:10,360 --> 00:01:11,430
If not,

13
00:01:11,900 --> 00:01:14,300
at least she'll be able
to protect herself.

14
00:01:15,260 --> 00:01:16,390
You're the weak one.

15
00:01:16,630 --> 00:01:18,090
Your whole family is weak.

16
00:01:24,900 --> 00:01:25,760
Watch closely.

17
00:01:26,160 --> 00:01:28,000
This sword technique
is called Cloudbreaker.

18
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:29,800
I will only demonstrate it once.

19
00:01:49,500 --> 00:01:50,330
Your turn.

20
00:02:04,430 --> 00:02:05,290
Cloudbreaker.

21
00:02:19,100 --> 00:02:20,300
How is this possible?

22
00:02:20,329 --> 00:02:23,100
It took me a month
to barely memorize this technique.

23
00:02:23,100 --> 00:02:24,400
She only saw it once

24
00:02:25,530 --> 00:02:27,190
and remembered it perfectly.

25
00:02:27,460 --> 00:02:28,329
Or

26
00:02:28,930 --> 00:02:30,590
is she hiding something else?

27
00:02:37,730 --> 00:02:38,500
Mister,

28
00:02:38,730 --> 00:02:40,390
I actually remembered it all.

29
00:02:40,400 --> 00:02:41,660
Aren't I amazing?

30
00:02:42,660 --> 00:02:43,800
What is going on?

31
00:02:44,260 --> 00:02:45,600
My body seems

32
00:02:45,730 --> 00:02:47,460
very familiar with this sword technique.

33
00:02:47,460 --> 00:02:49,660
It's as if I held a sword a long time ago.

34
00:02:53,900 --> 00:02:55,030
You remembered the moves,

35
00:02:55,030 --> 00:02:56,630
but without a trace of spiritual power,

36
00:02:56,630 --> 00:02:58,490
you couldn't even kill a chicken.

37
00:02:59,630 --> 00:03:00,430
You...

38
00:03:05,160 --> 00:03:07,220
Her talent exceeds my expectations.

39
00:03:07,330 --> 00:03:10,330
But I can't feel any spiritual power
in her body at all.

40
00:03:10,500 --> 00:03:12,030
Either she really doesn't have any,

41
00:03:12,030 --> 00:03:13,630
or it's hidden very deeply.

42
00:03:15,300 --> 00:03:16,360
Either way,

43
00:03:16,829 --> 00:03:18,230
I need to keep observing.

44
00:03:20,200 --> 00:03:21,460
We continue tomorrow.

45
00:03:21,600 --> 00:03:22,400
Don't be late.

46
00:03:25,460 --> 00:03:26,630
Don't be late.

47
00:03:27,260 --> 00:03:29,190
Does this mean he acknowledges me?

48
00:03:33,760 --> 00:03:36,329
Hmph, I'll definitely
impress you tomorrow.

49
00:03:54,500 --> 00:03:56,800
Mister said my moves are fine now.

50
00:03:56,800 --> 00:03:59,130
But I have absolutely no spiritual power.

51
00:03:59,360 --> 00:04:01,400
Even Bai can turn water into ice.

52
00:04:01,430 --> 00:04:03,560
Yet I can't even make a leaf move.

53
00:04:06,100 --> 00:04:06,700
Sister,

54
00:04:07,200 --> 00:04:08,230
take a break.

55
00:04:10,230 --> 00:04:12,630
I had the kitchen make you
some iced plum juice.

56
00:04:12,630 --> 00:04:13,700
Practicing the sword is too exhausting.

57
00:04:13,700 --> 00:04:15,630
You need to replenish your energy.

58
00:04:22,830 --> 00:04:25,130
Bai, why do you come running
to me every day?

59
00:04:25,130 --> 00:04:27,330
Doesn't Mister care about you anymore?

60
00:04:27,860 --> 00:04:29,400
That old monster is very busy lately.

61
00:04:29,400 --> 00:04:30,530
He has no time for me.

62
00:04:30,600 --> 00:04:31,700
Besides, it's only natural

63
00:04:31,700 --> 00:04:33,000
for me to come see you, Sister.

64
00:04:33,000 --> 00:04:34,830
Actually, the old monster
told me to follow her.

65
00:04:34,830 --> 00:04:36,659
And report any anomalies immediately.

66
00:04:36,659 --> 00:04:38,460
But I'm not going to tell Sister that.

67
00:04:38,460 --> 00:04:39,790
I'm playing both sides.

68
00:04:43,030 --> 00:04:46,400
Bai, do you think
I really have no spiritual power?

69
00:04:46,830 --> 00:04:47,900
But didn't you use
spiritual power to deal with

70
00:04:47,900 --> 00:04:49,900
the men in black that day?

71
00:04:50,060 --> 00:04:51,920
I don't know what that was either.

72
00:04:52,030 --> 00:04:54,530
But isn't it normal
to not have spiritual power?

73
00:04:54,530 --> 00:04:55,930
You are a mortal, Sister.

74
00:04:57,200 --> 00:04:59,200
But I don't feel like a mortal.

75
00:05:00,230 --> 00:05:00,760
Ah,

76
00:05:02,660 --> 00:05:04,730
the first thing I remember is

77
00:05:04,900 --> 00:05:06,900
falling from the sky into that pool.

78
00:05:07,500 --> 00:05:08,860
If I were a mortal,

79
00:05:08,860 --> 00:05:10,460
falling from that height

80
00:05:10,460 --> 00:05:11,660
would have killed me.

81
00:05:12,060 --> 00:05:13,830
And I can learn all the moves
that man taught me

82
00:05:13,830 --> 00:05:15,660
just by watching them once.

83
00:05:15,900 --> 00:05:18,400
That doesn't seem like
something a mortal could do.

84
00:05:18,400 --> 00:05:20,060
Let me help you test it.

85
00:05:20,900 --> 00:05:21,660
Test it?

86
00:05:22,260 --> 00:05:22,830
How?

87
00:05:28,060 --> 00:05:30,700
If you really have spiritual power
hidden inside you,

88
00:05:30,700 --> 00:05:32,730
it will trigger automatically
when you are attacked.

89
00:05:32,730 --> 00:05:33,330
Don't be afraid.

90
00:05:33,330 --> 00:05:34,860
I will control my strength.

91
00:05:47,300 --> 00:05:48,130
Bai,

92
00:05:49,200 --> 00:05:49,900
you...
